["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"173: 对话姚颂：深鉴、东方空间、再出发，「天才少年」十年后 WAM VLA latent space egocentric data 遥操\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-21-latetalk-姚颂十年三次创业-物理ai的答案不是小天才-而是系统/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e4332dff9f12ac9e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">2:55:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">晚点聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0721</span></div>\n<h2>姚颂：物理AI的胜负手不是小天才，是系统战</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">从深鉴到东方空间再到 Striding AI，姚颂判断物理AI的胜负手不是一两个天才算法，而是数据、算力、人才池和每个 milestone 的商业落地，智能优先的巨头也未必摘得到果实。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">物理AI</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Kimi K3: The open-weights escalation Kimi Delta Attention (KDA) Attention Residuals (AttnRes) Stable LatentMoE adversarial distillation decelerationist Entity List\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-20-interconnects-开闭源差距只剩-3-5-个月-这层时间差就是全部的安全边际/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ffff5b76a790c6c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">20:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0720</span></div>\n<h2>开源落后闭源只剩 3-5 个月，这层时间差就是全部安全边际</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Kimi K3 把开源落后闭源的差距从争论中的 6-9 个月压到 3-5 个月，而这层时间差正是唯一的风险缓冲——重手监管开源只会推迟不可避免的事，同时把缓冲本身作废掉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">中美竞争</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"But what is cross-entropy? | Compression is Intelligence Part 2 cross-entropy KL divergence distillation Lagrange multiplier Shannon limit\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-16-karpathy-训练语言模型本质上是在训练一个文本压缩器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ca853744f8d1a48a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Andrej Karpathy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0716</span></div>\n<h2>交叉熵损失为何胜出：它在训练一个文本压缩器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">交叉熵损失之所以被选中，是因为数学上可以证明它是唯一能保证「模型输出等于数据真实分布时损失最小」的函数形式，而这恰好等价于把模型训练成逼近香农极限的文本压缩器。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信息论</span><span class=\"tag\">交叉熵</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"146. 对Physical Intelligence柯丽一鸣4小时访谈：Pi的开源模型研究，机器人的江湖、族谱与主角 VLA in domain / out of domain Diffusion Policy sim2real throughput FAST\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-16-zhangxiaojun-机器人不需要人形-也能叠衣服做咖啡/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/44c9dfad5e507e0a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:48:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0716</span></div>\n<h2>机器人不需要人形，也能叠衣服做咖啡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Pi 用三篇主线论文把机器人大脑从能力推到泛化再到表现，柯丽一鸣认为人形不是现阶段最该解的问题，真机数据不可取代，机器人自己跑出来的体验数据才是下一步。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人大脑</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E244｜机器人走错路了？与苏度韩铮聊聊具身智能的3D数据、路径分野与硅谷竞赛 Sim2Real Zero-Shot VLA URDF teleops\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-16-sv101-机器人操作比运动控制难两三个数量级-硅谷却押错了方向/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0716</span></div>\n<h2>机器人操作比运动控制难两三个数量级，硅谷却押错了方向</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">苏度科技认为，硅谷主流端到端模仿学习路线在开放世界操作上存在根本缺陷，上下分层结构将在今年下半年重回主流。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Episode 127: Bashshar ibn Burd Shu&#x27;ubiyya badee apophasis al-adab qasida\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-15-litandhist-他用征服者的语言写诗-最后被缝进袋子扔进河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/43e959018e740613-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">2:02:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">文学与历史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0715</span></div>\n<h2>他用征服者的语言写诗，最后被缝进袋子扔进河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Bashshar ibn Burd 是释奴之孙、盲人诗人，用阿拉伯语讽刺阿拉伯人，骂哈里发还活了二十年——直到一句诗把他送进底格里斯河。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">阿拉伯诗歌</span><span class=\"tag\">阿拔斯王朝</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"‘Holy grail’ of naked mole-rat research reveals how queens rule isopropyl myristate naked mole-rat super-puff intuitive gamer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-15-naturepod-裸鼹鼠女王不靠尿液-靠一种5美元分子维持王位/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b247947db171866-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">22:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0715</span></div>\n<h2>裸鼹鼠女王靠5美元分子统治：不是尿液，是护肤成分</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">裸鼹鼠的生殖抑制信号终于被找到：女王独产 isopropyl myristate。把它加进失去女王的群体就和平，停掉就爆发王位战；同一种分子还出现在哺乳期女性身上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">裸鼹鼠</span><span class=\"tag\">化学信号</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"罗永浩的X字路口！一年一度装x大会 old money 尖团音\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-15-cn2d7912-装逼能不能成-拿捏的是文化隔阂的远近/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/570a4c2dc21c8b72-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">2:57:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0715</span></div>\n<h2>装逼能不能成，拿捏的是文化隔阂的远近</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">装逼的本质是用最少信息快速立住人设：隔阂太近等于没装，隔阂太远对方看不懂，也等于白装。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">装逼文化</span><span class=\"tag\">阶层鄙视链</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"172: Momenta IPO后再访曹旭东：就是想做没有尽头的AI world model RoboVan RoboTruck post-train data scaling\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-15-latetalk-智驾好和更好的行业-只容得下两三家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8cd6cf382873d1be-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">2:03:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚点聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0715</span></div>\n<h2>智驾供应商终局只剩两三家，窗口年底关闭</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Momenta 曹旭东判断，智驾像电池一样只有好和更好，三方供应商终局中国两三家、全球三四家；第一梯队市占率已90%，数据飞轮和量产是入场券，下一站是物理AI和家庭机器人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智能驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"CPU这个老登，竟然在智能体时代重新翻身了？ KV Cache RAS AMX PD分离 RDMA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-14-laoshi-智能体时代gpu常年堵车-cpu才是那套红绿灯系统/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5956a359adfacff7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"老\"><span class=\"dur\">22:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">老石谈芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0714</span></div>\n<h2>智能体时代GPU常年堵车，CPU才是那套红绿灯系统</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">智能体把AI工作方式从并行概率预测变成串行任务执行，GPU因为缺乏分支预测和乱序执行能力而频繁空转，CPU的逻辑调度能力因此成了数据中心新的稀缺资源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">CPU</span><span class=\"tag\">智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The Simplex Algorithm, Mathematical Details!!! simplex algorithm feasible region objective function slack variable Gaussian elimination ratio test\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-13-statquest-线性规划最优解不在内部-单纯形法只沿边界顶点爬/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aaa1aa79aeced790-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">27:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">StatQuest</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0713</span></div>\n<h2>线性规划最优解不在内部：单纯形法只沿边界顶点爬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">线性规划的最优解总在某个边界顶点上，所以单纯形法不搜索区域内部：从原点出发，用最大负数列选方向、最小比率定步长，不断换到收益更高的相邻顶点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">线性规划</span><span class=\"tag\">单纯形法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Adam Brown – A deep but accessible introduction to general relativity equivalence principle fictitious / inertial force Schwarzschild radius / event horizon gravitational time dilation spaghettification\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-10-dwarkesh-黑洞是效率-100-的发电厂-聚变只到百分之一/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9cb4dda1cfbcd52e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0710</span></div>\n<h2>黑洞是效率 100% 的发电厂，聚变只到百分之一</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把砖慢慢吊到视界正上方再松手，静质能可以 100% 变成远处的功；化学燃烧只有百亿分之一、聚变只有百分之一，因为核反应根本碰不到质子中子的静质量，只有引力能碰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">广义相对论</span><span class=\"tag\">黑洞</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"罗永浩的X字路口！如果可以，你会删除伴侣出轨的记忆吗？\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-10-cn2d7912-ai伴侣再完美也打动不了人-排斥非同类刻在基因里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0367758a99f46207-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">2:12:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0710</span></div>\n<h2>AI伴侣再完美也打动不了人：排斥非同类刻在基因里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">节目里最被认可的一个解释是：拒绝完美AI伴侣不是因为它不够好，而是人类基因里对非同类的本能排斥，再完美也绕不过去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">爱情观</span><span class=\"tag\">AI伴侣</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E243｜特朗普“缓刑”红牌之外，美国资本如何硬控全球足坛 Leveraged Buyout Asset Securitization Evergreen Fund Super League Matchday Revenue\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-10-sv101-美国资本硬控足坛-不只买队-还在收租/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0710</span></div>\n<h2>美资控盘英超11队，靠的不是足球是金融</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美资已控盘英超11支球队，还把手伸进欧足联商业开发、版权分销和球员转会金融；版权费见顶后，它们靠推高估值和永续基金继续玩。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">体育投资</span><span class=\"tag\">英超</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"269. 卷规模 VS 卷创作：真人短剧的两种生存模式 RY DIT 斩杀线 金手指\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-09-luanfanshu-月产-300-部短剧不靠灵感-靠本金安全与人物关系/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1b655f3a7a4cc727-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"乱\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">乱翻书</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0709</span></div>\n<h2>短剧两种活法：规模流保本金，内容流靠人物关系</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">短剧有两种活法：规模流靠本金安全与月产 300 部的确定性收益，内容流靠人物关系决定动机；两边都认为 AI 暂时取代不了真人的微表情。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">真人短剧</span><span class=\"tag\">产能管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E242｜最快半年AI跑通自进化？与陈天桥首席科学家聊聊硅谷模型必争之地 RSI Recursive Drift Heavy Duty Solver Discovery Model Agent Team\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-06-sv101-ai最快半年跑通自进化-验证与品味是最后门槛/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0706</span></div>\n<h2>AI自我进化最快半年跑通，但模型会悄悄跑偏</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">RSI 的拐点是模型能胜任长程任务。Apodex 首席科学家称最快半年跑通自我进化闭环，但递归漂移与模型品味仍需人类长期把关。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI自进化</span><span class=\"tag\">RSI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep 263: David Deutsch&#x27;s &quot;The Fabric of Reality&quot; Chapter 13 &quot;The Four Strands&quot; Part 4 - and final. universal explainer explanatory gap copper atom argument Conway&#x27;s Game of Life\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-04-tokcast-ai-至今没造出一个新理论-所以它不是人工人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cee80eb6567ee2d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:30:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">ToKCast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0704</span></div>\n<h2>AI 至今没造出一个新理论，所以它不是人工人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Deutsch 的判据是：AI 只是把已知理论里没算完的部分填上，属于给有机化学图景涂色。要够到创造新知识的门槛，得先有问题——而 LLM 没有问题，问题是我们给它的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">认识论</span><span class=\"tag\">多世界解释</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Narcissists: Are We Surrounded? NPI NPD Grandiose narcissism Gray rocking Empathy prompt Triple E\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-02-sciencevs-没有自恋流行病-自恋者只是更痛苦/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">44:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0702</span></div>\n<h2>自恋流行病是媒体炒作：数据不支持，患者其实更痛苦</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">媒体热炒的「自恋流行病」缺少数据支持；NPI 测得的自恋水平近年反而在下降。真正的 NPD 约 1%，患者常伴抑郁焦虑，治疗有效但需数年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自恋</span><span class=\"tag\">NPD</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Grant Sanderson – AI and the future of math grindability theory of mind RLVR Langlands Program\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-30-dwarkesh-数学家未来是策展人-价值不在证明里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4b8f892d1d8c883d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:33:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0630</span></div>\n<h2>数学家未来是策展人，价值不在证明里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 能解题、能解释、能证明定理；数学家的价值将转向判断哪条路值得走——并成为人们信任的策展人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数学</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 能力边界</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The next big breakthrough will be AIs learning on the job RLVR OPSD Dreaming KV cache Sample efficiency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-26-dwarkesh-ai-的下一个突破-在工作中学习-而非仅靠训练/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dd74222aed85378e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">19:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0626</span></div>\n<h2>AI 下一个突破不是训练，是让 AI 在工作中学习</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">实验室押注 RLVR 能泛化出通用智能，但真正的瓶颈是样本效率与持续学习。OPSD 与「做梦」或成关键，让 AI 从部署中学习，而非只靠预训练。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">持续学习</span><span class=\"tag\">RLVR</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"罗永浩的X字路口！不借钱给朋友，就会失去朋友失去钱！ Hirox\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-26-cn2d7912-罗永浩没跑路-是因为没提前把钱转出国/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b223004bec41efc0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">2:40:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0626</span></div>\n<h2>罗永浩没跑路，是因为没提前把钱转出国</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正跑路的企业家都是提前转移了财产的——罗永浩说自己没干这步棋，所以除了留下来一分一分把六七个亿还掉，别无选择。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业债务</span><span class=\"tag\">借钱</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EP4 王强：AI 狂飙时代，一个古典的人 FOMO brain rot interdependence mindfulness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-23-xiaotianzhang-真格联合创始人王强-新出的书-他一本都不读/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bdfe352669029443-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"小\"><span class=\"dur\">1:45:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">小天章</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0623</span></div>\n<h2>真格联合创始人王强：新出的书，他一本都不读</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他的理由是：一本书今天被一亿人同时追捧，下个月可能只剩一千万人记得——畅销本身就是会被时间淘汰的证据，所以他把阅读时间全部留给经过几十年检验的旧书。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">阅读方法论</span><span class=\"tag\">AI创业逻辑</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Walt Disney Company Flywheel Multiplane camera Cel animation Pencil test Seven Powers\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-22-acquired-迪士尼飞轮-艺术-商业与工程的百年复利/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/372eb871b3602a8b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">4:31:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0622</span></div>\n<h2>迪士尼护城河不是IP，是Walt的飞轮设计</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">迪士尼的护城河不是IP本身，而是Walt将艺术与商业在脑中结合后，用工程手段打造的飞轮：高质量动画、最大化发行、注入辅助节点，再以数十年复利滚动。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">IP运营</span><span class=\"tag\">飞轮效应</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Episode Summary 10: Burnout vs Depression: The Mental Load of Mothers Burnout DSM Medicalization Benzodiazepines\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-15-parentmojo-妈妈不是病了-是社会病了-抑郁诊断如何转移问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">18:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0615</span></div>\n<h2>妈妈不是病了，是社会病了：抑郁诊断如何转移问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Burnout 被误诊为抑郁，问题被归因于个体大脑而非社会环境。新西兰研究发现，每天有人帮做家务六个月的产妇几乎不产后抑郁，但药物仍是首选方案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">抑郁诊断</span><span class=\"tag\">母亲 burnout</span>\n</div></div></a>"]